# Raw HYG star catalog CSV (~120k rows, ~34MB) — only the filtered/converted output in
# src/assets/stars-mag7.5.bin is checked in. Download from astronexus/HYG-Database's
# hyg/CURRENT/hygdata_v41.csv (see README.md) before running `npm run build:stars`.
# The contents are ignored rather than the folder, so that one input set can be kept: the nova
# catalogue's (under 1 MB), which is what makes `npm run build:novae` reproducible if its sources
# move or disappear — and V1369 Cen's points were read out of a figure by hand.
scripts/data/*
!scripts/data/novae/

dist-site/
dist-site-lib/

# Generated from the TypeScript by build:schema — never edited, and rebuilt before anything
# that reads it is built.
src/generated/

# scripts/perf output
perf-out/
